al shaved lateral margin   is an unoriented fibrofatty breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  It is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in X Z  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary lymph nodes   is adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm  A lymph node dissection is performed and lymph nodes are submitted as follows  AA BB  One lymph node  bisected  CC  One lymph node  bisected  DD  One lymph node  bisected  EE  Five lymph nodes  FF  Five lymph nodes  Resident  SARAH ROLLINS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     Lymph node sentinel  metastatic carcinoma  O R  Resident  HEIKE VARNHOLT  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Janey Sue Pratt  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES  SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  ADDITIONAL LEFT   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT   FINAL MEDIAL SHAVED MARGIN PART E  BREAST  LEFT   FINAL SHAVED DEEP MARGIN PART F  BREAST  LEFT   FINAL SHAVED SUPERIOR MARGIN PART G  BREAST  LEFT   FINAL SHAVED INFERIOR MARGIN PART H  BREAST  LEFT   FINAL SHAVED LATERAL MARGIN PART I  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY   EXCISION , Unchecked.
