ng 0 6cm in diameter  Section Code A C   tumor and inked deep resection margin D H   additional resection of tumor I J   unremarkable breast parenchyma K   nipple L   skin scar M O   axillary lymph nodes Resident  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST , Unchecked.
