n  0 7cm of the superior margin  1 4cm of the inferior margin  1 1cm of the lateral margin  and 0 4cm of the medial resection margin  SECTION CODE B  Lateral margin  en face  C  Closest superficial margin  D  Deep and superior margins  E  Deep and inferior margins  F  Medial margin  radially  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast deep  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm portion of fibrofatty tissue  The surgeon verbally oriented the specimen as the fragment adjacent to the deep resection margin of the main specimen  The new deep resection is inked black and the specimen is sectioned to reveal a firm  gritty  lobular  stellate shaped  tan gray mass  measuring 0 4cm in the superficial to deep plane  and 1 1cm and 0 6cm in the other planes  Representative sections in relation to the inked new deep surgical margin are submitted in cassettes G and H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast anterior margin  are two irregular fragments of fibroadipose tissue  REMOVED_DATE x 1 4x 0 8cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  Each piece contains a suture denoting the edge furthest from tumor  and this aspect is inked blue  The remainder of the specimen is inked black  Both pieces have focally fibrous parenchyma with no masses  The larger piece is entirely submitted in I J and the smaller piece is entirely submitted in cassette K  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  L breast medial deep margins  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular portion of fibroadipose tissue  with a short double suture indicating the aspect furthest from the tumor  a single short suture indicating the superior aspect  and a long single suture indicating the medial aspect  The aspect furthest from the tumor appears to be the anterior and is inked blue and the remainder of the specimen is inked black  with o