en has been oriented with a stitch designating 12 o clock  The REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm pink tan overlying skin has an unremarkable REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm nipple and an ill defined area of blue coloration  The fatty resection margin is inked as follows  Anterior   blue  and Posterior   black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm pink tan lobular firm mass which is 1 2cm from the deep posterior resectioned margin and more than 2 0cm from the remaining margins  The remaining breast reveals unremarkable pink tan fibrous and tan yellow fatty tissue  The axillary portion is sectioned to reveal several potential lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor to posterior resection margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional sections of tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma away from tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Potential lymph nodes submitted entirely  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right axillary sentinel node  are multiple soft tissue fragments measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in aggregate  The fat is dissected to reveal three potential lymph nodes which are bisected and separately and entirely frozen as FX 1  FX 2  and FX 3  now submitted as cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  The remaining specimen is submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  skin margin right breast  is an annular piece of tan pink skin measuring 9 5cm in length with a width of 0 6cm and excised to a depth of a 1 0cm  The resection margins are unremarkable and inked black  The outer resection margin is shaved and submitted entirely in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION