mors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  25 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 31 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm fragment of breast in three pieces  pierced by a localizing wire  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm fleshy  granular  partially circumscribed lesion  A representative section is frozen as FX 1  now in cassette A  The rest of the specimen is submitted in B through I  with the main lesion in B though D  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT  BIOPSY  DUCTAL CARCINOMA PROBABLY INVASIVE  O R  Resident  ESTHER OLIVA  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Edi Brogi  M D   PhD  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
