rgin  No discrete mass lesion is grossly appreciated  and there is an ill defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm area of dense gray white fibrotic tissue which focally abuts the inferoposterior margin  Sections of the two hemorrhagic areas and gray white fibrous tissue in B G are submitted as B G  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  JULIE ANN NAGLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL  EXCISION PART B  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
