cm from the superior margin  1 5cm from the inferior margin  and 2cm from the posterior margin  1cm from the lateral margin and 5cm from the medial margin  The gelatinous area around the nodule abuts the lateral supero posterior margin  A metal clip was found  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section containing the nodule and the surrounding gelatinous area to the different margins  with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing the nodule and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing the sections where a metal clip was identified   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  radially sectioned showing a relationship of gelatinous area to margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial margin en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section away from gelatinous area  unremarkable parenchyma  Received fresh  and labeled  right breast additional lateral margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 3cm fibrofatty soft tissue specimen  unoriented  The specimen is entirely inked black  serially sectioned to reveal fibrofatty top surface  The entire specimen is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  and labeled  right breast biopsy  needle localization   short stitch   anterior  long stitch   lateral  bowtie   cephalad   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm fibrofatty ovoid soft tissue specimen with a needle localization wire in place with stitches designating the different margins  short stitch   anterior margin  long stitch   lateral margin  bowtie stitch   superior margin  The long axis of the specimen is anteroposterior  The specimen is inked as follows  Superior   blue  inferior   black  medial   green  lateral   yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from anterior to posterior to reveal a firmer area containing two metal clips  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm  located 0 6cm from the posterior margin  1 2cm from the medial margin  1 7cm from the superior margin  1 6