y have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  29 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 13 29 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibroadipose tissue with a long single suture designating the medial aspect  a short double suture designating the superior and a long double suture designating the anterior aspect  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior black  the superior green and the inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm well delineated indurated  tan white focally hemorrhagic gritty mass which abuts the posterior  is 0 4cm from the anterior  0 7cm from the superior  1 0cm from the inferior  1 7cm from the lateral and 1 8cm from the medial margins respectively  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma is tan yellow to pink lobulated  unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted in A F as follows  A B  mass closest to posterior margin  C  mass to closest anterior margin  D  mass to closest superior margin and representative section of tumor  E F  uninvolved parenchyma with the medial margin radially sectioned in cassette E  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast final inferior  are two irregular tan yellow to pink unoriented portions of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The specimens are serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette G H with the smaller portion in cassette G and the larger port